    "created_at": "2022-06-04T00:01:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-04T00:01:57Z",
    "body": "It looks like all the engines don't run subsequent listeners after the event target's context gets detached. For Blink and WebKit, this follows from where we're checking this; for Gecko, I think the listeners get cleared on detach, so iteration over the listeners stops after detach.\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, there would need to be a check in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener-inner-invoke to account for detaching from a listener. I'll try to send a PR next week along with some tests.",
